{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0553_1000_014mir", "source_sha256": "5a57a4f3a11a8c26d20c1ccf34311cfa53ba1cad0fa1e8bd3abeee119f1c5a8c", "ja": "{$P$}さん、聞いてくださ～い！\n今日、すごいことがあったんです！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，您快听我说～！\n今天发生了超厉害的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0553_1001_p", "source_sha256": "95270545c50ee877e4b2e08a864e3c6933fbeea3d7877a85124f7707a2bcc3c3", "ja": "お疲れ様、未来。\nどうしたんだ、そんなに慌てて。", "zh": "辛苦了，未来。\n怎么了，慌慌张张的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0553_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "46222fb68c597566b015808eb8ac618b6fcdeca1faf66fc2fbeec6f4af7d7dd7", "ja": "実は、テストが返ってきたんですけど……\nなんと私、数学で80点だったんです！", "zh": "其实是考试卷子发下来了……\n我数学居然考了80分呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0553_1003_p", "source_sha256": "40e8c9ead96f53329685d2e645aa218aeda1d927adff8e33aa0c48ba26e517af", "ja": "おお、すごいじゃないか！", "zh": "哦哦，真厉害啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0553_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "d17870e2fdbe24974eaf067ab13f4235aa9e86506da64d46cffaf0eb0d9a0d43", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとうございます♪\nこれも一夜漬けのおかげと……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢您♪这也多亏了临时抱佛脚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0553_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "c333f6b5490e039187c1a1cb0fa8bb3e93fce567ce172e4fe215b46420c3e8c5", "ja": "この前の『アイドル受験クイズ』で、\n最下位をとったおかげです♪", "zh": "多亏之前在《偶像应试问答》里拿了倒数第一♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0553_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9204347d179f02597ec62a608f56a212ec68d62ba928867cc4ef3cb192019ad3", "ja": "ん？　というと……？", "zh": "嗯？你的意思是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0553_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "5952a9472c71cd26afdea013814ecdc22c688fa5ad848977e33736eb3d915267", "ja": "私が最下位だったのって、答えを\n書くとこがズレちゃってたからじゃないですか。", "zh": "我得了最后一名，不就是因为答题的时候填错位置了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0553_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "1befb6067bc30459c59d0a4cf1c9e75a3882f15ea078bea0093d45f87e466710", "ja": "だから今回は、そんな間違えをしないように、\n何度も見直しをしたんです！", "zh": "所以这次为了不再犯那种错误，我检查了好多遍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0553_1009_p", "source_sha256": "68bc8e8275dd3207ce3bc4f8579aea06559efac96ed666ca2b1371517f293097", "ja": "なるほど……。", "zh": "原来如此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0553_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "e383be0cbe2d699e8bf473e1431d01f448a14ec287a21f644d2c47d35f7a4096", "ja": "そしたら、細かい計算ミスをたくさん見つけちゃって。\nバッチリな状態で出せたのは、見直しのおかげです！", "zh": "然后，我发现了很多细小的计算错误。\n多亏重新检查了一遍，才能以完美的状态提交！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0553_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "0394091e347c260dcd8f35551d1b2d7436ea4e46d9667c9cf8f9be9e2d59c38b", "ja": "最下位はちょっぴり恥ずかしかったですけど……\n今は、あのミスをしてよかったなって思ってます♪", "zh": "垫底虽然有点丢脸啦……\n但现在觉得，当时犯那个错误真是太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0553_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e75d6cedee0e783ed9adca72cc9425b1f1ffc6342a35e461417c94b78f8bc8cf", "ja": "おお……！\n失敗を教訓にして、うまく活かせたわけだな！", "zh": "哦哦……！\n也就是说，你把失败当成教训，成功地吸取了经验啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0553_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "36eea0c9ce9708b6bf7fc63ecb96ee89bc5ad5dfffad76b5f102b90580d1aa35", "ja": "きょうくん……？\nはい、多分それです！　『きょうくん』のおかげです！", "zh": "教训……？\n对，大概就是这个！多亏了“教训”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0553_1014_p", "source_sha256": "7e148c20231520fd037efbb5473ef620233ce6427d0346610f7545ca76bcbf61", "ja": "そ、そうか……。\nうん！　何にせよ高得点おめでとう、未来！", "zh": "是、是吗……。\n\n嗯！不管怎么说，恭喜你拿到高分，未来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0553_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "bb64eb4c8c9b5389df18a94884bdd23a1d9b225134c7465a4bfc4cc0cf21623f", "ja": "でへへ～、ありがとうございま～す♪\nそれじゃ私、みんなにも報告してきますね～！", "zh": "嘿嘿～谢谢大家～♪\n那我去跟大家也报个喜啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
